{
  "id": "lp.close",
  "internal": true,
  "name": {
    "en": "Goal audit and closeout",
    "ru": "Аудит целей и закрытие"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Checks every goal's done_when against evidence, detects intent drift, stages knowledge candidates and updates project life.",
    "ru": "Сверяет каждую цель done_when с доказательствами, ловит дрейф намерения, кладёт кандидатов знаний на стейджинг и обновляет жизнь проекта."
  },
  "inputs": {
    "goals": {
      "type": "Goal[]"
    },
    "boundary": {
      "type": "Boundary"
    },
    "goal": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "merged_commits": {
      "type": "string[]"
    },
    "summary": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "insights": {
      "type": "any",
      "note": "кандидаты из ретроспективы, если есть"
    },
    "proof_currency": {
      "type": "string",
      "note": "git: какие записанные доказательства ещё покрывают код, а какие устарели (машина считает перед аудитом)"
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "status": "closed|unmet",
    "unmet_ids": "string[]",
    "intent_aligned": "bool",
    "staged": "int",
    "candidate_ids": "string[]",
    "report_path": "string",
    "goals": "GoalResult[]",
    "drift_items": "string[]"
  },
  "entry": "goal-screen",
  "budget": {
    "max_steps": 8,
    "max_minutes": 30
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "goal-screen",
      "type": "jev",
      "label": "Goal audit screen",
      "judgment": "close.goal_screen",
      "state": {
        "goals": "{{$inputs.goals}}",
        "merged_commits": "{{$inputs.merged_commits}}",
        "summary": "{{$inputs.summary}}",
        "proof_currency": "{{$inputs.proof_currency}}"
      },
      "output": [
        {
          "name": "decision",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "value",
          "type": "json",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "settled",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "escalated",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "goals",
          "type": "array",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "all_met",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "unmet_ids",
          "type": "array",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "intent_aligned",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "drift_items",
          "type": "array",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "handoff",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "goal_audit",
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "auditor",
      "title": {
        "en": "Goal audit",
        "ru": "Аудит целей"
      },
      "skip_when": "$mode == 'quick' && $inputs.goals.length <= 1",
      "skip_out": {
        "goals": "[]",
        "all_met": true,
        "unmet_ids": "[]",
        "intent_aligned": true,
        "drift_items": "[]"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:prepare/ralph.md (post-goal-audit, post-reground)",
      "prompt": "For each goal check `done_when` against evidence (command output, file:line, test result); met only with evidence you re-checked now.\n`proof_currency`, when given, is git's own verdict on whether each recorded proof still covers the code: use it, do not work currency out from git by hand. A proof marked STALE, NOT ON THIS HISTORY or UNKNOWN COMMIT is not current evidence: re-check that goal on the code as it is now and name the changed paths in the evidence.\nintent_aligned=false when the result drifts from the original goal: two or more in_scope items missing or one out_of_scope item violated (confident drift at 80%+).\nDifferent model from the writer. Never ask the owner for what the repository can answer.\n",
      "out": {
        "goals": "GoalResult[]",
        "all_met": "bool",
        "unmet_ids": "string[]",
        "intent_aligned": "bool",
        "drift_items": "string[]"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "consumes": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "goal-screen"
        },
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "goal_audit"
        }
      ],
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "memory",
      "title": {
        "en": "Stage knowledge",
        "ru": "Кандидаты знаний"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:ref/finish-work.md, ref/knowledge-closeout.md",
      "prompt": "Stage candidates only, never publish. Keep decisions, locked constraints and lessons; drop process narration and what the code already says.\nconfidence = +0.3 locked or explicit decision, +0.2 three or more keywords, +0.2 rationale, +0.2 length 50-2000, +0.1 reference; threshold 0.5.\nPublication needs the owner's explicit approval; no answer means deferred. An auto mode is not approval.\n",
      "out": {
        "staged": "int",
        "candidate_ids": "string[]",
        "deferred": "bool"
      },
      "guards": {
        "timeoutMin": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "life",
      "consumes": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "memory"
        }
      ],
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "project-life",
      "out": {
        "status": "updated|no_change",
        "commit": "string"
      },
      "prompt": "Update the project's life files from what this run delivered (the merged commits, the audit report, the staged knowledge): .agents/PROGRESS.md, CHANGELOG.md, plans/ and todos/ entries. Touch nothing else; status no_change when there is nothing to record."
    },
    {
      "id": "report",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "path": "reports/{{run_id}}.md",
      "out": {
        "report_path": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "closed",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "closed",
        "unmet_ids": "[]",
        "intent_aligned": true,
        "staged": "memory.staged",
        "candidate_ids": "memory.candidate_ids",
        "report_path": "report.report_path"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unmet",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "unmet",
        "unmet_ids": "goal_audit.unmet_ids",
        "intent_aligned": "goal_audit.intent_aligned",
        "goals": "goal_audit.goals",
        "drift_items": "goal_audit.drift_items"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unmet-jev",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "unmet",
        "unmet_ids": "goal-screen.unmet_ids",
        "intent_aligned": "goal-screen.intent_aligned",
        "goals": "goal-screen.goals",
        "drift_items": "goal-screen.drift_items"
      },
      "output": [
        {
          "name": "status",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "goal-screen",
      "to": "unmet-jev",
      "when": "goal-screen.settled == true && goal-screen.escalated == false && (goal-screen.all_met == false || goal-screen.intent_aligned == false)"
    },
    {
      "from": "goal-screen",
      "to": "memory",
      "when": "goal-screen.settled == true && goal-screen.escalated == false"
    },
    {
      "from": "goal-screen",
      "to": "goal_audit"
    },
    {
      "from": "goal_audit",
      "to": "unmet",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "!goal_audit.intent_aligned || !goal_audit.all_met"
    },
    {
      "from": "goal_audit",
      "to": "memory",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "memory",
      "to": "life",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "life",
      "to": "report",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "report",
      "to": "closed",
      "pass": "artifact"
    }
  ],
  "status": "published"
}